  "ingredients": [
    "2.5 cups whole wheat flour",
    "2 large eggs",
    "0.5 cup canned pumpkin",
    "2 tablespoons peanut butter",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon water, or more if necessary"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l5J3-EXcSwpXA-43OrBVvgRoA1E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/133123-Peanut-Butter-and-Pumpkin-Dog-Treats-mfs-STEP-001-05c323442ccf4668b081ebb9395fdc6a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/133123/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, eggs, pumpkin, peanut butter, salt, and cinnamon in a bowl; stir with a spatula until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CjW8Kk-LcnkcWvUysuDjq_npOgY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/133123-Peanut-Butter-and-Pumpkin-Dog-Treats-mfs-STEP-008-eac31b1457d74e62abbb76e701aefec1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/133123/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer mixture to a work surface and work it with your hands until mixture starts to come together. Add 1 teaspoon water at a time (only if needed) to help make the dough workable, but don't add too much as it should be dry and stiff. Roll the dough to a thickness of 1/2 inch.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QqFE2wen8V-DTDXKDLZpMX9cHyQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/133123-Peanut-Butter-and-Pumpkin-Dog-Treats-mfs-STEP-013-e411272295034a34a88dc20dfe8cca98.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/133123/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut into 1/2-inch pieces and transfer to a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fX9VuskLNiUPmTFAZ65-DV1gVbk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/133123-Peanut-Butter-and-Pumpkin-Dog-Treats-mfs-STEP-016-8d74bb8f25b047fdbd40379e0b7e3d18.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/133123/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until dog treats are golden brown and crunchy, about 40 minutes. Let cool before serving to your dog.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Lujzl03CEbifFMCNPWoCFZZAUmY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/133123-Peanut-Butter-and-Pumpkin-Dog-Treats-mfs-012-52ab3711d2954226a640adebcb2f0969.jpg"
